e/posts/3d-model/"},{"name":"iiif-manifest","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/3d-model/manifest.json"}],"path":"/posts/3d-model","section":["/posts"],"summary":"\u003ch1 id=\"3d-model-manifests\"\u003e3D model manifests\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGLB resources are emitted as Presentation API 4 \u003ccode\u003eScene\u003c/code\u003e containers with painting annotations of the type \u003ccode\u003eModel\u003c/code\u003e. The \u003ccode\u003ebare.glb\u003c/code\u003e resource has no sibling poster image — its Scene simply has no thumbnail, the build doesn\u0026rsquo;t fail. See \u003ca href=\"/iiif/page-metadata/#3d-models/\"\u003ePage metadata\u003c/a\u003e for the full rules.\u003c/p\u003e","title":"3D model manifest","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/3d-model/"},{"date":"2024-01-15T00:00:00Z","lang":"en","outputs":[{"name":"html","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/"},{"name":"rss","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/index.xml"}],"path":"/posts","section":[],"summary":"","title":"Posts","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/"},{"date":"2024-01-15T00:00:00Z","lang":"en","outputs":[{"name":"html","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/"},{"name":"iiif-collection","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/collection.json"}],"path":"/","section":[],"summary":"\u003ch1 id=\"introduction\"\u003eIntroduction\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe goal of this site is to provide some documentation of the functionality of this base theme and to use the provided examples as test cases in an CI environment. See also \u003ca href=\"/todo\"\u003eTODO\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","title":"Projektemacher Base template","url":"https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/"}]